ZCL_COMMAND_READY_READ(
    "zcode.package.dev.tasks", "zcode.package.dev", "zcode.tasks",
    "List local dev tasks",
    "Rebuilds the local dev-task index from the workspace CAS on every call. "
    "Persisted task.v1 and candidate.v1 wires are the only task truth; each "
    "projected wire must parse, validate, and rederive the root that names "
    "its CAS object, and no task table exists. Projects task root, source "
    "root, exact write-scope root, candidate-declared source and patch roots, expiry, derived state, "
    "and evidence counts. details=true adds the latest projected candidate, "
    "context, receipt-selected action, work-receipt, lane-proof and lane-receipt "
    "roots, verified claimed write paths, plus bounded candidate authors. "
    "scope_offset pages the claimed paths in deterministic canonical order. "
    "A claimed path is collision evidence, never an ownership or execution "
    "claim; missing or corrupt scope bytes fail the detailed view closed. Active "
    "execution and assignment remain explicitly UNOBSERVED because CAS "
    "authorship is not ownership. Filters accept task_root, source_root, "
    "and author hex prefixes plus an exact state.",
