ZCL_COMMAND_READY_READ(
    "zcode.package.library", "zcode.package", "",
    "List complete packages this node can seed",
    "Bounded catalog of complete tracked packages in the local package "
    "store — the shelf this node can seed. Each row is one 64-hex "
    "`package_root` with complete/pinned, file_count, total_bytes, "
    "total_chunks, public_serveable (the public-shape classifier; no swarm "
    "engine lock), and `name` when a persisted release in the rebuildable "
    "index names that root. Every row also carries a `reproduction` "
    "object: the local receipts scan for that package+recipe "
    "(receipts_scanned, receipts_matching, reproduced, publishable — the "
    "exact predicate the pointer publish gate applies — "
    "distinct_toolchains, cross_toolchain, rows_truncated), or an `error` "
    "string when the row is unevaluable (no persisted release names the "
    "root) or the envelope/scan is unreadable; evidence never fails this "
    "read-only view. Top-level `evaluated_count` and `reproduced_count` "
    "census the rendered rows. Capped at 64 (the local-announce bound); "
    "limit "
    "raises only within that cap. An empty store is a passed empty list, "
    "not an error. `next_command` names one obvious next step: fetch by a "
    "listed local name or root, or how to fetch when the shelf is empty. "
    "dumpstate zcode_store reports totals; this leaf is the per-root "
    "catalog.",
    ZCL_COMMAND_LIST_BUDGET,
    "zcode,package,library,store,shelf,seed,catalog",
    "zcl.zcode_package_library.input.v1", "zcl.zcode_package_library.v1",
    "limit,datadir", "",
    "z23 zcode package library",
    ZCL_COMMAND_LAYER_APP, ZCL_COMMAND_SCOPE_NODE, ZCL_COMMAND_AUTH_OPERATOR,
