    "Both modes return the canonical signed record_root so durable jobs can "
    "bind exact public evidence, plus the bounded canonical record_wire for "
    "independent parse/signature/chain verification and restart-safe storage. "
    "STORAGE_ACK is refused here and must use storage_ack, whose package-store "
    "proof cannot be supplied by the caller. The reply contains no secret "
    "key material. One exception to plan being a dry run: a POINTER in the "
    "zclassic23.attestation namespace is gated by re-admitting the "
    "attestation blob, which FILES those bytes under "
    "<datadir>/zcode/attestations on BOTH plan and commit — idempotent, and "
    "normally a no-op because zcode package attest offer filed them first.",
    16384, "zcode,network,dht,publish,provider,pointer,storage-ack,plan,commit",
    "zcl.zcode_network_publish.input.v1", "zcl.zcode_network_publish.v1",
